flowchart TD
  A[Receive request] --> B{Valid X-API-Key?}
  B -- No --> X1[401]
  B -- Yes --> C{Exactly one statement?}
  C -- No --> X2[400 reject]
  C -- Yes --> D{First verb matches endpoint?}
  D -- No --> X2
  D -- Yes --> E{Forbidden keyword or routine?}
  E -- Yes --> X2
  E -- No --> F{All read objects qualified and allowlisted?}
  F -- No --> X2
  F -- Yes --> G{Write target equals configured write schema?}
  G -- No --> X2
  G -- Yes --> H{Placeholder count matches parameters?}
  H -- No --> X2
  H -- Yes --> I[Acquire pooled SQLJob]
  I --> J[Execute prepared SQL]
  J --> K[Return normalized JSON]
